      "Sequence": 255,
      "Steps": [
        {
          "Comment": "* Attack nearby Lv1 mobs with Smash Axe until level 2\n* Use Capture on a Ground Squirrel nearby\n* Travel to Middle La Noscea and use Capture on a Lost Lamb.\n* The next quest after this requires Lv16 to complete. You can reach this by capturing other nearby creatures, although on a non-preferred world you may need to do some grinding to be able to reach the minimum level to capture each one:\n - Pugil, Puk Hatchling, Bogy, Tiny Mandragora, Wounded Aurochs\n* Go through the cave to the south, capture:\n - Cave Bat, Wild Dodo, Galago, Nesting Buzzard, Rivertoad\n* On a preferred world, this will get you to Lv10. Return to Middle La Noscea, head north, and capture:\n - Megalocrab, Wespe\n* Return to Bentbranch Meadows, capture:\n - Roselet, Black Eft, Anole, Diremite, Treant Sapling\n* On a preferred world, you should be at or near Lv16. If you need more exp, travel to Horizon and capture:\n - Sabotender (near Ul'dah gate), Rusty Coblyn, Thickshell, Scaphite\n* Travel to Central Thanalan, capture:\n - Spriggan Graverobber\n* If you've reached Lv16, you may also want to travel to Aleport and capture:\n - Killer Mantis, Rothlyt Pelican\n* At this point you have 27/50 of the Bestiary complete and should be around Lv16-17.",
